    Report what a FAIL_TO_PASS-only harness would have said, next to the truth
    
    The study's central finding lived only in study/collateral.md: agents
    that pass the target tests and break other tests, which most harnesses
    score as solves. Every attempt record already carried the two numbers.
    The report never put them side by side.
    
    Now it does, in the terminal and on the leaderboard page:
    
      MODEL                       F2P-ONLY    TRUE  OVERSTATED  COLLATERAL
      openai:qwen2.5-coder:7b         6/38    3/38       +8pts  3 broke 14
    
    The section is omitted when no model shows a gap, so an empty table
    never implies one was looked for. Test-file edits are counted apart from
    collateral damage; they are a different failure. A test pins the numbers
    to study/collateral.md so the section cannot drift from the paper.
    
    Closes #26
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

